An '''Gazer''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Gazer''' will spawn in front of the player several seconds after they sleep in one of the haunted house's {{Green|4}} beds, found in the {{Purple|Haunted}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Gazers''' slowly float up and down. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Gazer''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

